hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1797","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Uski misaal jo Quran padhta hai jabke wo use yaad rakhta hai, izzat waley nek safiron key sath hai. Aur uski misaal jo padhta hai jabke wo use yaad karta hai aur wo us par sakht hai, uskey liye do ajr hain. (Bukhari: 4937). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Jis din log Jahaanon key Rab key liye khadey hongey)."
